    "plan_update_summary": "### Cycle #67 Quantitative Review & Parameter Mutation\nOut-of-sample testing with DeepSeek V4.1 Flash achieved a 50.0% win rate and positive gross expectancy (+\u20b918.32), but finished net negative (-\u20b916.56) due to \u20b934.88 in statutory and brokerage fees. Forensics on the false-positive cluster revealed morning entries suffering exact stop-loss whipsaws at the `0.68%` boundary, while post-13:30 IST entries stalled into `EOD_SQUARE_OFF` where modest gross gains were erased by transaction costs. To convert positive gross alpha into net profitability, we are widening `min_sl_pct` to `0.74%` to absorb NSE morning order-book noise, elevating `min_sweep_vol_multiplier` to `2.85x` to filter out weak midday breakouts, and tightening `min_target_pct` to `1.35%` alongside an accelerated `0.85R` breakeven trigger to capture profit before afternoon theta and fee drag take effect."
